## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                      BINANCE API                            │
│                  (WebSocket + REST)                         │
└────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┘
                     │
┌────────────────────▼────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              DENSITY SCREENER BOT                           │
│         (density_screener_prod.py)                          │
│                                                             │
│  • Fetches orderbook depth                                 │
│  • Detects large densities                                 │
│  • Tracks density lifecycle                                │
└──────────┬─────────────────────────┬────────────────────────┘
           │                         │
           ▼                         ▼
  ┌────────────────┐        ┌─────────────────┐
  │     REDIS      │        │   POSTGRESQL    │
  │                │        │                 │
  │ • Price cache  │        │ • Densities     │
  │ • Active data  │        │ • Events log    │
  │ • 300s TTL     │        │ • Statistics    │
  └────────┬───────┘        └────────┬────────┘
           │                         │
           └──────────┬──────────────┘
                      │
           ┌──────────▼──────────────────────┐
           │      FASTAPI SERVER             │
           │      (api_server.py)            │
           │                                 │
           │  • REST endpoints               │
           │  • WebSocket streaming          │
           │  • CORS for Mini App            │
           └──────────┬──────────────────────┘
                      │
           ┌──────────▼──────────────────────┐
           │   TELEGRAM MINI APP             │
           │                                 │
           │  • Real-time table              │
           │  • Filters & sorting            │
           │  • Charts (future)              │
           └─────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## ✨ Features

### Core Functionality
- ✅ Real-time orderbook depth scanning
- ✅ Large density detection (customizable thresholds)
- ✅ Distance tracking from current price
- ✅ Density lifecycle events (detected, approached, touched, disappeared)
- ✅ Multi-symbol support with volume filtering

### Storage & Persistence
- ✅ **Redis** — Real-time cache with 300s TTL
- ✅ **PostgreSQL** — Full history & event logging
- ✅ Three-layer architecture (Memory → Redis → PostgreSQL)
- ✅ Automatic cleanup of stale densities

### API & Integration
- ✅ **REST API** — /api/densities, /top, /near, /events
- ✅ **WebSocket** — Real-time streaming to clients
- ✅ **Health checks** — /health endpoint
- ✅ **CORS enabled** — Ready for Mini App

### Telegram Features
- ✅ Bot commands: /top, /near, /symbol, /pause, /resume, /status
- ✅ Cycle summaries with statistics
- ✅ Smart batching (no spam)
- ✅ Customizable notifications

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### 1. Prerequisites

```bash
# Required
- Python 3.10+
- Docker & Docker Compose
- Telegram Bot Token (from @BotFather)

# OR install Redis + PostgreSQL locally
```

### 2. Clone & Install

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone <your-repo>
cd density-screener

# Install Python dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Copy environment template
cp .env.example .env

# Edit .env with your credentials
nano .env
```

### 3. Start Infrastructure

```bash
# Start Redis + PostgreSQL with Docker
docker-compose up -d

# Check services are running
docker-compose ps

# Initialize database schema
psql -h localhost -U screener -d density_screener -f schema.sql
# Password: screener_password_change_me
```

### 4. Run Services

```bash
# Terminal 1: Start screener bot
python density_screener_prod.py

# Terminal 2: Start API server
python api_server.py

# Or use uvicorn directly
uvicorn api_server:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload
```

### 5. Verify

```bash
# Check bot logs
tail -f screener.log

# Test API
curl http://localhost:8000/health
curl http://localhost:8000/api/densities?limit=5

# Check Telegram
# Send /status to your bot
```

