## 📦 Production Deployment

### Docker Deployment

```bash
# Build images
docker build -t density-screener:latest .

# Run with docker-compose
docker-compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml up -d
```

### Systemd Service

Create `/etc/systemd/system/density-screener.service`:

```ini
[Unit]
Description=Density Screener Bot
After=network.target docker.service

[Service]
Type=simple
User=your_user
WorkingDirectory=/home/your_user/density-screener
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 density_screener_prod.py
Restart=always
RestartSec=10

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

```bash
sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl enable density-screener
sudo systemctl start density-screener
sudo systemctl status density-screener
```

### Nginx Reverse Proxy

```nginx
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name api.yourdomain.com;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://localhost:8000;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
    }
}
```

